@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 2.0 Pengelolaan Event

actor "Organizer" as O
participant "System" as S
database "Database" as D
actor "Admin" as A

== Buat Event ==

O -> S : Isi form buat event + upload banner
S -> D : Simpan data event (status: pending)
D --> S : Data event tersimpan
S -> D : Simpan jadwal & lampiran
D --> S : Data jadwal tersimpan
S --> O : Tampilkan "Event berhasil dibuat"

== Admin Verifikasi Event ==

A -> S : Buka daftar event pending
S -> D : Ambil data event pending
D --> S : Daftar event
S --> A : Tampilkan daftar event

A -> S : Review & Approve/Reject event
S -> D : Update status event
D --> S : Status terupdate
S --> O : Kirim notifikasi status event

@enduml
